d on upload stopped with size ~ 2^31.\n\n$ curl -F fl=@/tmp/file_3gb.zip 'http://localhost:9000/upload'\n\n```\npublic Result upload() {\n    final Http.MultipartFormData formData = request().body().asMultipartFormData();\n    // here I have formData=null, in case of a huge file\n    final Http.MultipartFormData.FilePart filePart = formData.getFiles().get(0);\n    System.out.println(filePart.getFile().length());\n    return ok();\n}\n```\n\n$ ls -l /tmp/mul*\n-rw-r--r-- 1 user user 2147483474 Oct 17 13:40 multipartBody8725824905039407210asTemporaryFile\n\nAccording to [java/2.1.4] sources I decided, that the issue is related to (maxLength: Int) in Handlers, and didn't got simple solution.\n\nSo, I had to rewrite Controller on Scala to avoid the problem.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/playframework/playframework/issues/comments/26492980/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"vlasas","id":671451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MTQ1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/671451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vlasas","html_url":"https://github.com/vlasas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vlasas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vlasas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vlasas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vlasas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vlasas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vlasas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vlasas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vlasas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vlasas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/playframework/playframework/issues/comments/26566464","html_url":"https://github.com/playframework/playframework/issues/1666#issuecomment-26566464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/playframework/playframework/issues/1666","id":26566464,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI2NTY2NDY0","user":{"login":"jroper","id":105833,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTgzMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105833?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroper","html_url":"https://github.com/jroper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-10-18T01:29:16Z","updated_at":"2013-10-18T01:29:16Z","body":"Ok, a few problems here in the Java:\n\n1) maxLength is an Int (actually, same with Scala)\n2) maxLength is used for multipartFormData parsing (not used with Scala, probably should be, but should be a Long)\n\nDid you have `parsers.text.maxLength` configured?  If so, what was it set to?\n\nI propose that we change maxLength to a long, both in the Scala and Java APIs, have a different configuration setting for configuring the default max length for multipartFormData, and use this both for Java and Scala, and make the max length configurable in Scala.  Default maybe should be something like 2mb.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/playframework/playframework